synergy = "Needs structure ×1.15. Integrity = 14 kJ × structure ÷ 1.45. Takes the left arm: two-handed guns go away, so pair it with the GX-4 or the whip in the right arm, or bash (R3: shove ×1.6, so mass, strength and impact)."
